    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Hudson Properties proudly present this beautiful 4 bedroom 4 bathroom semi detached property to the market. \n\nThis spacious home comes to the market in meticulous condition having been exceptionally well maintained by its current owners. Offering an ample amount of bright airy and spacious living accommodation together with modern décor throughout, briefly the property comprises of an entrance hallway, kitchen/dining, utility room, living room and guest wc all downstairs. Upstairs there are 4 good sized bedrooms, two of which are ensuite together with the family sized bathroom. This property has the added benefit of a large side entrance to the rear garden and has ample room for parking to the front. \n\nRidgewood Manor is situated on the edge of the Curragh plains and ideally situated close to all amenities including creches, primary and secondary schools, supermarkets, bars, restaurants, Bank and much more. Kildare town is also home to the world famous Kildare Village Outlet Shopping which is c.2.4 km away. This property is ideal for any commuter as the town benefits from a fantastic bus service, train station and access to the motorway is only a stones throw away.\n\nViewing of this property is highly recommended strictly by prior appointment only. \n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nEntrance Hallway: Tiled flooring, alarm point \n\nKitchen: Tiled flooring, light fitting and spot lights, fully fitted kitchen, stainless steel splashback, stainless steel sink, dishwasher, oven, hob, extractor fan, kitchen island, double doors leading to living room \n\nUtility Room: Tiled flooring, back door leading to rear garden \n\nLiving Room: Wooden flooring, light fitting and spot lights, feature fireplace with stove insert, double doors leading to dining area \n\nGuest WC: Tiled flooring, tiled surround, WHB, WC\n\nBedroom 1 (Attic Room): Carpet flooring, walk in fully fitted wardrobe \n\nEnsuite: Tiled flooring, tiled surround, corner shower unit, WHB, WC, heated towel rail\n\nBedroom 2: Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe\n\nEnsuite: Tiled flooring, tiled surround, shower unit, WHB, WC \n\nBedroom 3: Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe \n\nBedroom 4: Carpet flooring, fully fitted wardrobe \n\nFamily Bathroom: Tiled flooring, tiled surround, bath, WHB, WC, heated towel rail \n\nFeatures:\n\nWired for alarm\nHardwood hall door\nSelected curtains and light fittings included \nPVC double glazed windows\nAttic access \nOutside tap\nPatio area to rear\nSide gate entrance to rear garden\nAir to Water Heating System\nMains water\nMains sewage\nBuilt in 2017\nc.150.5sqmt \n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. "
      },
